hov-qt (1.2.0-1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian/Ubuntu packaging of the Linux Qt6 desktop build (v1.2.0):
    - aggregation of YouTube / Bilibili / NetEase Cloud Music / QQ Music
    - libmpv playback, gpu-next opt-in with render-verification guard
    - yt-dlp based downloads, local library, storage management
    - XDG portal driven light/dark theme following
    - launcher wrapper handling LC_NUMERIC/libmpv locale requirement

